# clamber-scenario v1
id: bounce-walker
summary: Stand still, then jump straight up and hold jump; land on a walker coming toward the player and bounce off it.
requires: flat ground at least 120 px to the left and 200 px to the right of the player; one walker (behavior/walker.md) on that ground, heading left at full speed (vx -1), its x 75.828125 px to the right of the player's x when frame 0 begins; no other entities or carryable objects within 300 px
start: grounded, idle for at least 30 frames, facing right, lead character
frames: 140

[inputs]
20-139   J

[metrics]
bounce_height    tol 0.5
final_x          tol 1
curve x,y,vy from bounce for 40 tol 0.25
